    LLM: 'Blinds. Deal 2 hole cards each. Pre-flop betting. Flop (3 community cards), turn (1), river (1). Betting after each. Showdown: best 5-card hand from 7. Win by best hand or all fold.',
    Player: 'Blinds. Deal 2 hole cards each. Pre-flop betting. Flop (3 community cards), turn (1), river (1). Betting after each. Showdown: best 5-card hand from 7. Win by best hand or all fold.',
    objective: 'Make the best five-card poker hand using any combination of your two hole cards and the five community cards. Win chips by having the best hand at showdown or by making all other players fold.',
